{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】北角晚上有貨車撞到女途人昏迷送院。</p>\n<p>涉事貨車車頭損毀，司機在場協助調查。晚上10時許，該食環署外判清潔承辦商貨車沿英皇道東行左轉入書局街，撞到一名女子，她受傷昏迷，由救護車送到東區醫院。意外原因有待調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:40.465401+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:28:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:41.791492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:41.791492+00:00","content_hash":"c18bee3225b98d9c3fd76c88782ea43b03bbad1dc342b47eb07ec3271c4bd5f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}